{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you feel the call of the void? Are you <strong>drawn </strong>to <strong>drift</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then you came to the right place. <strong>But be careful!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Braking and turning are especially challenging in space. Without <strong>friction</strong>, only those who master control over their ship can avoid all obstacles and reach the finish line in time - or at all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752160/extras/fa75332cac6027ab808622a67dc8b1bc.poster.avif?t=1769000768\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752160/extras/fa75332cac6027ab808622a67dc8b1bc.webm?t=1769000768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752160/extras/fa75332cac6027ab808622a67dc8b1bc.mp4?t=1769000768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SINGLEPLAYER</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the <strong>campaign</strong> and unlock <strong>stars</strong>, colorful <strong>titles</strong> and prestigious <strong>skins</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drift</strong> on endless <strong>community</strong> tracks or <strong>draw</strong> one yourself</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against <strong>ghosts </strong>of past legends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize</strong> your <strong>ship</strong> and <strong>tag</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752160/extras/90ebeec1b7f2f77ed5afedfb458f9265.poster.avif?t=1769000768\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752160/extras/90ebeec1b7f2f77ed5afedfb458f9265.webm?t=1769000768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752160/extras/90ebeec1b7f2f77ed5afedfb458f9265.mp4?t=1769000768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every track a <strong>server</strong> - drift in real time\u00a0<strong>together</strong> with <strong>friends</strong> and <strong>rivals</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the <strong>leaderboards</strong> and ascend in 5 <strong>global</strong> categories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in the <strong>Ranked Duel</strong> mode and become the most <strong>consistent\u00a0</strong>drifter</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752160/extras/f238902957a58b9d2b20b7118635b316.poster.avif?t=1769000768\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752160/extras/f238902957a58b9d2b20b7118635b316.webm?t=1769000768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752160/extras/f238902957a58b9d2b20b7118635b316.mp4?t=1769000768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CREATOR</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draw</strong>\u00a0custom tracks in the powerful track <strong>editor</strong> and become the most <strong>famous</strong> <stro